llenges face our heroine, as she struggles against a pushback on emancipation, leading to many doubts, both internal and external. Uncover the truth in a mystery full of deception!", "themes": [{"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-case-of-distrust", "videos": [{"id": 13459, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Fd4K6BTOG28", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fd4K6BTOG28", "title": "A Case of Distrust | Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fd4K6BTOG28/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}